{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國影視圈傳出憾事。曾執導殺手樂團（The Killers）、MGMT及拱廊之火（Arcade Fire）等知名樂團音樂錄影帶的導演雷廷托里（Ray Tintori）於本月10日在紐約住處被發現身亡，享年43歲。根據《Page Six》報導，詳細死因仍待進一步檢驗釐清。</p><p>根據外媒報導，《週六夜現場》前班底演員海蒂（Heidi Gardner）加德納因遲遲無法聯繫上男友，心急之下請造型師友人布里特西奧多拉代為報警，希望警方前往住處關切。初步勘驗未發現刑事犯罪跡象，現場也沒有發現違禁藥品或相關器具。至於遺體是由友人或救護人員最先發現，目前各方說法不一。</p><figure><img alt=\"Ray Tintori（Instagram@raytintori）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200388194844020736402753.jpeg/-LJ3qf4D1cyDMomHtG8QcdMft635oXgFWn4kr1p-JK8\"/><figcaption>Ray Tintori（Instagram@raytintori）</figcaption></figure><p>雷廷托里與海蒂加德納去年7月底才透過Instagram公開戀情，如今兩人才公開認愛一年多，男友卻傳出驟逝消息，讓海蒂加德納悲慟不已。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：《變相怪傑》名導Chuck Russell逝世　曾一手捧紅占基利狄維莊遜】查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157982557082488832791863.png/lp0h3yeiYGVvn6SwojE7iM2Log-fPYJCsoWLgrKFi4I\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：《變相怪傑》名導Chuck Russell逝世　曾一手捧紅占基利狄維莊遜】查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell曾執導《變相怪傑》捧紅占基利。（《變相怪傑》正式海報）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983469188550656654839.jpeg/mIFgb53X404Yx-aAwnsNnB_NLwWPDScpeSLEtXkixLU\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell曾執導《變相怪傑》捧紅占基利。（《變相怪傑》正式海報）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell曾執導《盜墓迷城外傳：蠍子王傳奇》捧紅狄維莊遜。（《盜墓迷城外傳：蠍子王傳奇》正式海報）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983466776694784789251.jpeg/cwSg77lNj_nB_Iog3NlNJgvhnYCt3pc1hF-NgoRfjYI\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell曾執導《盜墓迷城外傳：蠍子王傳奇》捧紅狄維莊遜。（《盜墓迷城外傳：蠍子王傳奇》正式海報）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983241433518080956038.png/6bbqJ32oCO_POrmUDxBjrIKLWJnMdqYnSL0810i9PNc\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983243929260032371940.png/mkb1l5k8ptEN58lEXtQu4c0x5mrJsywx96s_u_erP7s\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983246123012096842016.png/q-F_qhjM-oKN8hxcdLYxKRnS4v0hNr029noymfZ6Mpk\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983248291598336826047.png/rt5mLRSHjbIDtWfBgK7yv19H_KEZW4kjKGbr9Chm6_Q\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1157983250548264960320485.png/KXAwhmVC93YnfdwOWAR5msTEvHzZtcOnabj7o2m4-6M\"/><figcaption>查克羅素Chuck Russell（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><p>家庭悲劇令人鼻酸</p><p>據《TMZ》報導，雷廷托里的母親瑪麗塞布爾斯基也是影視工作者，曾擔任場記及劇照師，卻在去年11月因腦癌辭世。如今母子相隔約一年先後離世，消息傳出令親友及影視同業相當不捨。</p><figure><img alt=\"Ray Tintori（Instagram@raytintori）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200388754871685120746098.png/NBnBgWnmd3MUXgeJFNaSQp2232en5URHykN968pDfes\"/><figcaption>Ray Tintori（Instagram@raytintori）</figcaption></figure><p>導演生涯成就斐然</p><p>雷廷托里自2000年代末期開始活躍於短片及音樂錄影帶創作領域，憑藉鮮明的視覺風格受到業界關注。他的作品涵蓋多個知名樂團，包括殺手樂團、MGMT及拱廊之火等，展現出獨特的藝術風格。除了音樂領域外，他也曾參與《南荒的童話》（Beasts of the Southern Wild）影視團隊「Court 13」的創作工作，並於前年的電影《Marty Supreme：癲造之才》（Marty Supreme）參與拍攝，作品橫跨音樂與電影領域。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：《超人狄奧》中田乃愛逝世得年23歲　遺作下月上映最後帖文惹惋惜】中田乃愛外型甜美可愛，在觀眾心中好感度極高。（《超人狄奧》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198999008484265984978051.jpeg/cO0Xg0eM1bqW4i3mtKK4rZXyUZ-yMJULOLPMHDizzBw\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：《超人狄奧》中田乃愛逝世得年23歲　遺作下月上映最後帖文惹惋惜】中田乃愛外型甜美可愛，在觀眾心中好感度極高。（《超人狄奧》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000703582867456869043.jpeg/WAP8Wzu4BZCdd1R0KeGE8B3K43ObGGSqJCJ2WCQidlg\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000706053443584195832.jpeg/LbGX2KJpGOvulA54HoB7_CfMIg2aSL75ZcEdbWXBHW0\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000708440133632029451.jpeg/Ma2-XUClGfKfViQLzz4T-GWg2EyRfQ2aL_a3yS_2t8k\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000710965235712821357.jpeg/iqYD_98D9bjntq28pp7OCkbdkkCtiAvbvY_QOb2P0Dk\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000713054130176796024.jpeg/R4u1mRWQw_9pkVdcrl5-ay2sEr_mfqLH-oSVV_qElVc\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000702299410432659043.jpeg/OwK8wNokOBEDkzrzpJpOroxlDXPkmEZXGs_prhrP6a4\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000704698683392095164.jpeg/v3U16o95iHJB5Wq4CGEin3v71_-54ZBYw1C-1MNQvtQ\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000707022458880407286.jpeg/c_88MBB8wll08Bx96hxisw0m4EqbziOY8_AvxfPwL8U\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000709228793856564732.jpeg/ODaQd0qIUezUq9rKK0TN2DSP0hzeYb5IUeIdylHiHco\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000711464488960251463.jpeg/1h-d7rwszgsfc1FjUJkjnfPkCeOF6giibuO3aW7jt2k\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000698914607104745923.jpeg/g0KABoWQUddTZyygNtiscAr1YaXtGrp69OomyPTqJsg\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><p>「烈火悍將」名導麥可曼恩靶場遭槍擊！送醫搶救</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:23:59.864414+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1470,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:15:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:26.077935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:17:27.814353+00:00","content_hash":"0b741a3a242634fc984f11497c1c9dcb1028ccdd527db073e0898185cfa8aed7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}